@startuml api-bet-leaderboard
title GET /api/bet/leaderboard — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

note right
  **Public route** — no **X-User-Access-Token**;
  no **RequiresFoundationUser** in controller.
  Source: **PredictionLeaderboardController::index**
end note

|Client|
start
:GET /api/bet/leaderboard\noptional query **page** (default 1),\n**per_page** (default 25, max 100);

|Laravel|
:Dispatch **PredictionLeaderboardController::index**;

|PredictionLeaderboardController|
:**page** = max(1, (int) query page);
:**per_page** = min(100, max(1, (int) query per_page));

|PointsBalance (Eloquent)|
:Query **points_balance** table;
:**ORDER BY** balance **DESC**, uid **ASC**;
:**paginate**(per_page, page);

|PredictionLeaderboardController|
:**base** = (currentPage - 1) * perPage;
:Iterate paginator **items** in order,\nfor each row: **rank** = base + 1-based index,\nemit { rank, uid, **score**: row.balance };

:**logHandledApiRequest**\n(handler: prediction.leaderboard.index);
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**(\n  items, pagination:\n  total, per_page, current_page, last_page\n);

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
